('true_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] > Open > target.bin  // lalu tekan F5 untuk Hex-Rays decompiler','bash','["pwntools","Frida","Ghidra","IDA Pro"]'::jsonb,'["pwntools","Frida","Ghidra","IDA Pro"]'::jsonb,3,'IDA Pro (Disassembler): Mengubah binary terkompilasi menjadi kode assembly/pseudo-C yang bisa dianalisis manusia.','IDA Pro (Disassembler): Turns compiled binaries into assembly/pseudo-C code a human can analyze.','Tools ini bernama IDA Pro, fungsinya: Mengubah binary terkompilasi menjadi kode assembly/pseudo-C yang bisa dianalisis manusia.','This tool is called IDA Pro, and it: Turns compiled binaries into assembly/pseudo-C code a human can analyze.','Buka file binary, telusuri fungsi lewat Graph View, lalu beri nama ulang variabel agar mudah dibaca.','Open the binary, navigate functions via Graph View, then rename variables to make it readable.','Obfuscation memperlambat reverse engineering tapi tidak mencegahnya total — jangan jadikan itu satu-satunya proteksi.','Obfuscation slows reverse engineering but never fully prevents it — don''t make it your only protection.'),
