('true_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari IDA Pro?','What is IDA Pro used for?','// IDA Pro — Disassembler','bash','["Menulis aturan untuk mengenali dan mengklasifikasikan file malware berdasarkan pola string/byte.","Mengubah binary terkompilasi menjadi kode assembly/pseudo-C yang bisa dianalisis manusia.","Menemukan bug dan crash pada program dengan membombardirnya memakai input acak yang dimutasi cerdas.","Pustaka Python untuk mempercepat pengembangan exploit binary: membangun payload dan berinteraksi dengan proses."]'::jsonb,'["Writes rules to identify and classify malware files based on string/byte patterns.","Turns compiled binaries into assembly/pseudo-C code a human can analyze.","Finds bugs and crashes in a program by bombarding it with smartly-mutated random input.","A Python library that speeds up binary exploit development: crafting payloads and interacting with a process."]'::jsonb,1,'IDA Pro: Mengubah binary terkompilasi menjadi kode assembly/pseudo-C yang bisa dianalisis manusia.','IDA Pro: Turns compiled binaries into assembly/pseudo-C code a human can analyze.','IDA Pro adalah kategori "Disassembler".','IDA Pro falls under the "Disassembler" category.','Buka file binary, telusuri fungsi lewat Graph View, lalu beri nama ulang variabel agar mudah dibaca.','Open the binary, navigate functions via Graph View, then rename variables to make it readable.','Obfuscation memperlambat reverse engineering tapi tidak mencegahnya total — jangan jadikan itu satu-satunya proteksi.','Obfuscation slows reverse engineering but never fully prevents it — don''t make it your only protection.'),
('true_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] /project [TOOL]_proj -import target.bin -postScript Analyze.java','bash','["Volatility","Covenant","Ghidra","Burp Collaborator"]'::jsonb,'["Volatility","Covenant","Ghidra","Burp Collaborator"]'::jsonb,2,'Ghidra (Reverse Engineering Suite): Suite reverse engineering gratis buatan NSA: disassembler, decompiler, dan analisis binary.','Ghidra (Reverse Engineering Suite): NSA''s free reverse-engineering suite: disassembler, decompiler, and binary analysis.','Tools ini bernama Ghidra, fungsinya: Suite reverse engineering gratis buatan NSA: disassembler, decompiler, dan analisis binary.','This tool is called Ghidra, and it: NSA''s free reverse-engineering suite: disassembler, decompiler, and binary analysis.','Buat proyek, import binary, jalankan auto-analysis, lalu baca hasil dekompilasi fungsi targetnya.','Create a project, import the binary, run auto-analysis, then read the decompiled target function.','Kode yang sudah dikompilasi tetap bisa dibaca logikanya — jangan taruh secret (API key) di dalam binary.','Compiled code''s logic can still be read — never embed a secret (API key) inside a binary.'),
