('true_god','guess','Apa fungsi dari Ghidra?','What is Ghidra used for?','// Ghidra — Reverse Engineering Suite','bash','["Menyuntik dan memodifikasi perilaku aplikasi (termasuk mobile) saat berjalan, tanpa rekompilasi.","Memantau trafik jaringan secara real-time dan memberi peringatan saat pola serangan terdeteksi.","Suite reverse engineering gratis buatan NSA: disassembler, decompiler, dan analisis binary.","Debugger binary tingkat rendah; GEF menambah fitur khusus eksploitasi seperti cek proteksi biner."]'::jsonb,'["Injects and modifies an app''s behavior (including mobile apps) at runtime, without recompiling.","Monitors network traffic in real time and alerts when attack patterns are detected.","NSA''s free reverse-engineering suite: disassembler, decompiler, and binary analysis.","A low-level binary debugger; GEF adds exploitation-focused features like checking binary protections."]'::jsonb,2,'Ghidra: Suite reverse engineering gratis buatan NSA: disassembler, decompiler, dan analisis binary.','Ghidra: NSA''s free reverse-engineering suite: disassembler, decompiler, and binary analysis.','Ghidra adalah kategori "Reverse Engineering Suite".','Ghidra falls under the "Reverse Engineering Suite" category.','Buat proyek, import binary, jalankan auto-analysis, lalu baca hasil dekompilasi fungsi targetnya.','Create a project, import the binary, run auto-analysis, then read the decompiled target function.','Kode yang sudah dikompilasi tetap bisa dibaca logikanya — jangan taruh secret (API key) di dalam binary.','Compiled code''s logic can still be read — never embed a secret (API key) inside a binary.'),
