('true_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] -i seeds/ -o findings/ -- ./target @@','bash','["Ghidra","IDA Pro","Radare2","AFL++"]'::jsonb,'["Ghidra","IDA Pro","Radare2","AFL++"]'::jsonb,3,'AFL++ (Fuzzing Framework): Menemukan bug dan crash pada program dengan membombardirnya memakai input acak yang dimutasi cerdas.','AFL++ (Fuzzing Framework): Finds bugs and crashes in a program by bombarding it with smartly-mutated random input.','Tools ini bernama AFL++, fungsinya: Menemukan bug dan crash pada program dengan membombardirnya memakai input acak yang dimutasi cerdas.','This tool is called AFL++, and it: Finds bugs and crashes in a program by bombarding it with smartly-mutated random input.','Kompilasi program dengan afl-cc, siapkan input awal, lalu jalankan fuzzer dan pantau crash yang ditemukan.','Compile the program with afl-cc, seed it with initial input, then run the fuzzer and watch for crashes found.','Fuzzing rutin di CI/CD menemukan crash sebelum rilis, jauh lebih murah daripada ditemukan penyerang di produksi.','Routine fuzzing in CI/CD finds crashes before release — far cheaper than an attacker finding them in production.'),
