('true_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] -U -f com.target.app -l hook.js','bash','["pwntools","Ghidra","BloodHound","Frida"]'::jsonb,'["pwntools","Ghidra","BloodHound","Frida"]'::jsonb,3,'Frida (Dynamic Instrumentation): Menyuntik dan memodifikasi perilaku aplikasi (termasuk mobile) saat berjalan, tanpa rekompilasi.','Frida (Dynamic Instrumentation): Injects and modifies an app''s behavior (including mobile apps) at runtime, without recompiling.','Tools ini bernama Frida, fungsinya: Menyuntik dan memodifikasi perilaku aplikasi (termasuk mobile) saat berjalan, tanpa rekompilasi.','This tool is called Frida, and it: Injects and modifies an app''s behavior (including mobile apps) at runtime, without recompiling.','Tulis skrip JavaScript yang meng-hook fungsi target, lalu lampirkan ke proses yang sedang berjalan.','Write a JavaScript script that hooks the target function, then attach it to the running process.','Pemeriksaan integritas (root/jailbreak detection) yang kuat mempersulit instrumentasi runtime seperti ini di aplikasi mobile.','Strong integrity checks (root/jailbreak detection) make runtime instrumentation like this much harder on mobile apps.'),
