('true_god','guess','Tools apa yang dipakai di sini?','Which tool is being used here?','[TOOL] http://abc123.oastify.com/ssrf-test','bash','["YARA","Burp Collaborator","Semgrep","Ghidra"]'::jsonb,'["YARA","Burp Collaborator","Semgrep","Ghidra"]'::jsonb,1,'Burp Collaborator (Out-of-Band Testing): Mendeteksi celah yang tidak terlihat langsung (blind) dengan memancing server target menghubungi server eksternal.','Burp Collaborator (Out-of-Band Testing): Detects invisible (blind) vulnerabilities by tricking the target server into contacting an external server.','Tools ini bernama Burp Collaborator, fungsinya: Mendeteksi celah yang tidak terlihat langsung (blind) dengan memancing server target menghubungi server eksternal.','This tool is called Burp Collaborator, and it: Detects invisible (blind) vulnerabilities by tricking the target server into contacting an external server.','Sisipkan subdomain unik Collaborator ke parameter yang dicurigai, lalu tunggu interaksi DNS/HTTP masuk.','Insert a unique Collaborator subdomain into the suspected parameter, then wait for incoming DNS/HTTP interactions.','Celah SSRF/blind injection sering tidak terlihat dari respons biasa — pemantauan koneksi keluar server itu penting.','SSRF/blind injection flaws are often invisible in normal responses — monitoring a server''s outbound connections matters.'),
